+      "severity": "must-fix",
+      "check": "layer",
+      "evidence": "Still open. F02 (lines 772-778) and F06 to F08 (lines 808-814) need fixture rows inside dbt singular tests (transform/tests/test_place_county_unknown.sql, transform/tests/test_edit_window_rules.sql). The plan gives no path for those rows into the warehouse the singular test reads. F05 (lines 797-804) names the harness for test_late_after_restart and test_orphan_batch_excluded only. F02 also fails by design on its state 09 county 09999 row, so the same file cannot pass on the real build unless the fixture run and the real build are separated. Fix: name the mechanism (a dbt seed or a var-selected fixture warehouse run by run_engine_then_dbt), and state which run uses the fixture and which uses the real build."
